      ],
      "notes": "SECOND layer. The HRIS sender already withholds non-Lead-Gen hires (isLeadGenDepartment in src/lib/hr/new-hire-checklist-webhook.ts) and stamps lead_gen:true on every row it sends. This node re-checks: lead_gen === true, OR a department that normalises to \"leadgen\" (so an older or hand-trimmed payload without the flag is still gated). A blank or missing department with no flag matches NEITHER and gets nothing — fail closed. Do not delete this node; do not relax it to let unknown departments through.",
